    </h2>

    <div class="portfolio-grid">

        <div class="portfolio-item">
            <div class="portfolio-img-placeholder" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #111 0%, #333 100%);">
                <!-- Inline Star Accent -->
                <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="white" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="opacity: 0.9;">
                    <path d="M50 0C50 27.6142 27.6142 50 0 50C27.6142 50 50 72.3858 50 100C50 72.3858 72.3858 50 100 50C72.3858 50 50 27.6142 50 0Z"/>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="portfolio-content">
                <span class="portfolio-category">BRAND IDENTITY / LOGO</span>
                <h3>NOVA Star Visual System</h3>
                <p>
                    The official brand language developed for NOVA Studio, featuring custom star typography, minimalist geometry, and robust high-contrast aesthetics.
                </p>
                <a href="#enquiry" class="button button-outline" style="padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 10px;">INQUIRE SIMILAR</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="portfolio-item">
            <div class="portfolio-img-placeholder" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a 0%, #2a2a2a 100%);">
                <span style="letter-spacing: 4px; font-weight: 300;">DIGITAL EXPERIENCE</span>
            </div>
            <div class="portfolio-content">
                <span class="portfolio-category">UI / WEB DESIGN</span>
                <h3>Minimalist Portfolio Interface</h3>
                <p>
                    A high-performance, clean digital portfolio layout built to highlight creative work with maximum clarity and zero visual clutter.
                </p>
                <a href="#enquiry" class="button button-outline" style="padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 10px;">INQUIRE SIMILAR</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="portfolio-item">
            <div class="portfolio-img-placeholder" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d0d0d 0%, #262626 100%);">
                <span style="letter-spacing: 4px; font-weight: 300;">VISUAL COMMUNICATION</span>
            </div>
            <div class="portfolio-content">
                <span class="portfolio-category">GRAPHIC DESIGN</span>
                <h3>Editorial & Print Layouts</h3>
                <p>
                    Curated print layouts and visual graphics combining strict typographic hierarchy with modern grid systems for impactful brand storytelling.
                </p>
                <a href="#enquiry" class="button button-outline" style="padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 10px;">INQUIRE SIMILAR</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="portfolio-item">
            <div class="portfolio-img-placeholder" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #151515 0%, #383838 100%);">
                <span style="letter-spacing: 4px; font-weight: 300;">CONTENT SYSTEMS</span>
            </div>
            <div class="portfolio-content">
                <span class="portfolio-category">DIGITAL CONTENT</span>
                <h3>Creative Direction & Assets</h3>
                <p>
                    End-to-end creative digital deliverables engineered to engage audiences across multiple online touchpoints with consistent precision.
                </p>
                <a href="#enquiry" class="button button-outline" style="padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 10px;">INQUIRE SIMILAR</a>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<!-- ABOUT -->

<section class="about" id="about">

    <div>
        <p class="section-label">WHO WE ARE</p>

        <h2>
            More than<br>
            just design.
        </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="about-text">
        <p>
            NOVA Studio is an independent creative brand
            built around the power of ideas and visual
            communication.
        </p>

        <p>
            Our approach combines creativity, precision
            and a commitment to producing work with
            purpose and impact.
        </p>

        <p>
            We believe every great creation starts with
            an idea. Our mission is to bring those ideas
            to life.
        </p>
    </div>

</section>

<!-- PROJECT ENQUIRY SECTION -->

<section class="enquiry" id="enquiry">
    <div class="enquiry-container">
        <p class="section-label">START A PROJECT</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading" style="margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 45px);">Project Enquiry</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--grey); font-size: 14px;">Tell us about your goals and vision. Fill out the form below and we will get back to you promptly.</p>

        <form class="enquiry-form" onsubmit="handleEnquiry(event)">
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="name">YOUR NAME / ORGANIZATION</label>
                <input type="text" id="name" required placeholder="e.g. John Doe">
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="email">EMAIL ADDRESS</label>
                <input type="email" id="email" required placeholder="name@example.com">
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="service">PROJECT TYPE</label>
                <select id="service" required>
                    <option value="" disabled selected>Select a service</option>
                    <option value="Graphic Design">Graphic Design & Branding</option>
                    <option value="Digital Content">Digital Content & Assets</option>
                    <option value="Creative Project">Custom Creative Project</option>
                </select>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="message">PROJECT DETAILS</label>
                <textarea id="message" required placeholder="Describe your project, timeline, and objectives..."></textarea>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="button button-black">SUBMIT ENQUIRY</button>
            <div id="formSuccess" class="form-success">Thank you! Your project enquiry has been submitted successfully. NOVA Studio will be in touch shortly.</div>
        </form>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- CONTACT -->

